{"pin":"AB10324","subcodes":[{"code":"AB10324","anchor":"","first_line":"O my God! O my God! Thou seest these children who are the twigs of the tree of life, the birds of the meads of salvation","first_line_orig":"الهی الهی تری هولاء الاطفال فروع شجره الحیات و طیور حدیقه النجات لئالی صدف بحر  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"60","full_text_parts":["O my God!  O my God!  Thou seest these children who are the twigs of the tree of life, the birds of the meads of salvation, the pearls of the ocean of Thy grace, the roses of the garden of Thy guidance.\nO God, our Lord!  We sing Thy praise, bear witness to Thy sanctity and implore fervently the heaven of Thy mercy to make us lights of guidance, stars shining above the horizons of eternal glory amongst mankind, and to teach us a knowledge which proceedeth from Thee.  Yá Bahá’u’l-Abhá!"],"translations":[{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"meu","lang_name":"Motu"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"sv","lang_name":"Swedish"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"mt","lang_name":"Maltese"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"sne","lang_name":"Bau Bidayuh"},{"language":"ta","lang_name":"Tamil"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"el","lang_name":"Greek"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creole"},{"language":"az","lang_name":"Azerbaijani"},{"language":"dgz","lang_name":"Daga"},{"language":"de","lang_name":"German"},{"language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2.129","source":"ADH2","locator":"129","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2_5#05 p.161","